WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:02.870
You promised the world and I fell for it

00:00:02.870 --> 00:00:07.470
Put you first and you adored it

00:00:07.470 --> 00:00:09.830
Set fire to my forest

00:00:09.830 --> 00:00:11.760
And you let it burn

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:14.440
Sing off-key in my chorus

00:00:14.440 --> 00:00:16.360
Cause it wasn't yours

00:00:16.360 --> 00:00:21.480
I saw the signs and I ignored it

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:25.640
Rose-colored glasses are distorted

00:00:25.640 --> 00:00:28.320
Set fire to my purpose

00:00:28.320 --> 00:00:29.980
And I let it burn

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:36.940
You got off in the hurtin' when it wasn't yours, yeah

00:00:36.940 --> 00:00:41.250
We'd always go into it blindly

00:00:41.250 --> 00:00:46.120
I needed to lose you to find me

00:00:46.120 --> 00:00:50.590
This dancer was killin' me softly

00:00:50.590 --> 00:00:59.850
Needed to lose

00:01:09.440 --> 00:01:14.310
I gave my all and they all know it

00:01:14.310 --> 00:01:18.830
You turned me down and now it's showing

00:01:18.830 --> 00:01:21.390
And so we want to replace us

00:01:21.390 --> 00:01:25.970
It was easy, made me think I deserved it

00:01:26.700 --> 00:01:29.680
Let me think of healing, yeah

00:01:33.260 --> 00:01:38.890
I needed to lose you to find me
